+  // hdr_dump_dir: if a dump is due, the finished back buffer (the guest output and the UI are all in it by
+  // now, whichever way they were drawn) is copied for reading back, before it goes to the present state.
+  // Every paint here ends in the one Present below; the one that doesn't is frame generation's
+  // (PaintWithFrameGeneration, above). With nothing scheduled this is a check of the schedule.
+  std::optional<HdrDumpCapture> hdr_dump;
